# them there. Every other file drivers/map names must be present, or the build stops: a driver
# that silently does not reach the kernel is worse than one that fails to build.
#
# <path in the kernel tree>	<what puts it there>
bsd/dev/hakios.focaltech_fw.h	tools/touch-fw.py --header, out of the FocalTech firmware of the user's own phone
